DESCRIPTION:Nature Journal Hike at 10:30 a.m.\nMeeting Location: Overflow P
 arking Area (next to Trailhead)\nARRIVE ON TIME! Each attendee will receiv
 e their own nature journal (while supplies last) for this 60-minute easy h
 ike through a woods and field area. At several stops\, the naturalist will
  offer guided prompts to help you experience the outdoors and journal (wit
 h words or drawings) what you observe. At the conclusion of the hike\, you
 ’ll have the opportunity to decorate and personalize your journal with m
 arkers\, stamps\, and stickers!
GEO:39.092423;-86.423753
LOCATION:Monroe Lake\, Paynetown SRA\, Meet at Overflow Parking Lot (next t
 o trailhead)
SUMMARY:Nature Journal Hike\, Paynetown SRA (Monroe Lake)
URL;VALUE=URI:https://events.in.gov/event/nature-journal-hike-paynetown-sra
 -monroe-lake
CATEGORIES:Events
END:VEVENT
