DTEND:20261014T200000Z
DESCRIPTION:Autumn Colors Painting from 2:30 to 4 p.m.\nPaynetown SRA\, Act
 ivity Center: Patio\nDROP BY to create a fun painting with autumn colors! 
 Choose from several painting techniques/types to create your masterpiece.
GEO:39.092423;-86.423753
LOCATION:Monroe Lake\, Paynetown SRA\, Activity Center: Patio
SUMMARY:Autumn Colors Painting\, Paynetown SRA (Monroe Lake)
