DTSTART:20261017T140000Z
DTEND:20261017T153000Z
DESCRIPTION:Trapped in Amber from 10 to 11:30 a.m.\nPaynetown SRA\, Campgro
 und Playground\nDROP BY to learn about a unique kind of fossil that is pre
 served in solidified tree sap\, amber! And you can make your own faux ambe
 r fossil using glass stones.
GEO:39.092423;-86.423753
LOCATION:Monroe Lake\, Paynetown SRA\, Campground Playground
SUMMARY:ROCKS\, ROCK! Trapped in Amber\, Paynetown SRA (Monroe Lake)
