DESCRIPTION:Travel the “Road to Fossilization” from 5:30 to 7 p.m.\nPay
 netown SRA\, Campground Playground\nDROP BY to see if you can successfully
  complete the journey from living organism to fossil… Will you survive t
 o be discovered millions of years later? Or will you exit the road early a
 nd become lost to time? Successful “travelers” can select a fossil to 
 help remember their journey!
GEO:39.092423;-86.423753
LOCATION:Monroe Lake\, Paynetown SRA\, Campground Playground
SUMMARY:ROCKS\, ROCK! Travel the "Road to Fossilization"\, Paynetown SRA (M
 onroe Lake)
