DESCRIPTION:Fossil Dig Exploration from 10 to 11:30 a.m.\nOverflow Parking 
 Area (back end)\nDROP BY to search our “dig” for rocks\, minerals\, an
 d fossils – that you’re allowed (legally!) to take home with you! We
 ’ll have a few tools available to help you dig\, water to wash off your 
 finds\, and guides to common Indiana fossils to help you identify what you
  find.
