BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Monroe Lake DNR
DTSTAMP:20261114T061340Z
UID:tag:localist.com\,2008:EventInstance_53533859256812
DTSTART:20261024T213000Z
DTEND:20261024T233000Z
DESCRIPTION:Trick-or-Treating & Campsite Decorating Contest from 5:30 to 7:
 30 p.m.\nPaynetown SRA\, Campground (Electric Loops)\n\nWander the Campgro
 und in search of delicious treats\, handed out by your fellow campers\, wh
 ile checking out everyone’s creative Halloween campsite decorations! Imp
 ortant: At least one adult should accompany each group of children. \n\nYo
 u could win! Decorate your campsite and you’re automatically entered int
 o the contest! Prizes awarded to the top two sites\, as selected by camper
 s\, with a third prize to the “staff choice.”\n\nDon’t forget to vot
 e! Each CAMPSITE receives ONE BALLOT upon check-in for the weekend. Please
  do not “pre-judge” sites: walk the Campground during trick-or-treatin
 g hours (when all the decorations are up!)\, pick your favorite site\, and
  then drop off your ballot at the Campground Office by 8:30 p.m.\n\nWho wo
 n? Site numbers for the winners will be posted next to the Campground Offi
 ce by 9:30 p.m. on Saturday and posted on our Facebook page (facebook.com/
 monroelake) by 5 p.m. on Sunday. Prizes are distributed via mail to the na
 me/address listed on the campsite reservation.
GEO:39.092423;-86.423753
LOCATION:Monroe Lake\, Paynetown SRA\, Electric Campground
SUMMARY:GHOSTLY GATHERING: Trick-or-Treating & Campsite Decorating Contest\
 , Paynetown SRA (Monroe Lake)
URL;VALUE=URI:https://events.in.gov/event/ghostly-gathering-trick-or-treati
 ng-campsite-decorating-contest-paynetown-sra-monroe-lake
CATEGORIES:Events
END:VEVENT
