 eople.\n•    Recommended for ages 12 and up. \n•    Workshop Location:
  Paynetown SRA\, Activity Center\n\nJoin us for a relaxing afternoon of cr
 afting! Sip on hot cocoa or tea as you hand-paint a glass jar for a small 
 poured wax candle\, assemble a snowman ornament\, and make a set of Zentan
 gle gift tags with a winter theme. 60-75 minutes\n\nPlease note that all r
 egistrations are final. Refunds provided only if the workshop is cancelled
 .
